{"seq":2,"slug":"growth-mature-deepen","title":"成长期提频与成熟期价值挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/stage-strategy/growth-mature-deepen","wordCount":2654,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"成长期提频与成熟期价值挖掘\">成长期提频与成熟期价值挖掘</h1><p>客户完成第二单之后，运营的重心会发生一次不易察觉但关键的转移：从「让他回来」变成「让他买得更多、更频繁、更值钱」。这两件事看起来都是「促进复购」，但可优化的杠杆完全不同——成长期能改变的是<strong>购买间隔</strong>（他还需要被提醒才会想起你），成熟期能改变的是<strong>单次贡献与品类广度</strong>（他已经形成习惯，需要的是更高的钱包份额）。把两个阶段的动作混在一起，最常见的后果是给已经形成习惯的成熟客户发提频激励，等于把预算花在本来就会发生的事情上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成长期与成熟期的杠杆不同\">核心概念：成长期与成熟期的杠杆不同</h2><p>先看两个阶段的可调量。CLV 的贡献可以分解成三个因子的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CLV</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>购买次数</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>单次贡献</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><msub><mtext>survival</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>留存时长</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CLV}_i \\approx \\underbrace{n_i}_{\\text{购买次数}} \\times \\underbrace{\\bar{m}_i}_{\\text{单次贡献}} \\times \\underbrace{\\text{survival}_i}_{\\text{留存时长}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CLV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0597em;vertical-align:-1.4763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">购买次数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.202em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 