6 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">survival</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>成长期主要影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（提高频次），成熟期主要影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{m}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（提高单次价值）。留存时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>survival</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{survival}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">survival</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两个阶段共同作用的长期结果，但它的最大杀手中期看不是竞品，而是体验退化（履约变慢、价格变化、货损）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>可调因子</th>\n<th>核心抓手</th>\n<th>有效的度量</th>\n<th>无效的度量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成长</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（频次）</td>\n<td>节奏培养、交叉品类、订阅化</td>\n<td>平均购买间隔、30/60/90 天复购率</td>\n<td>GMV 总量（被新客涌入污染）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{m}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（单次贡献）</td>\n<td>客单提升、品类广度、增值服务、权益</td>\n<td>客单价、品类数、净贡献/单</td>\n<td>购买次数（已接近该品类上限）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[客户完成第二单] --&gt; B{阶段判定}&#10;  B --&gt;|成长| C[提频抓手]&#10;  B --&gt;|成熟| D[价值挖掘抓手]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[购买节奏预测与提醒]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[消耗周期订阅化]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[品类扩展推荐]&#10;  C --&gt; C4[阈值激励: 差一单达标]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[客单提升: 组合装/加购]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[品类广度: 相邻品类]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[增值服务: 延保/优先配送/专属]&#10;  D --&gt; D4[权益分层: 见第四章第2篇]&#10;  C1 --&gt; E[购买间隔缩短]&#10;  C2 --&gt; E&#10;  C3 --&gt; E&#10;  D1 --&gt; F[单次净贡献提升]&#10;  D2 --&gt; F&#10;  D3 --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[客户完成第二单] --&gt; B{阶段判定}\n  B --&gt;|成长| C[提频抓手]\n  B --&gt;|成熟| D[价值挖掘抓手]\n  C --&gt; C1[购买节奏预测与提醒]\n  C --&gt; C2[消耗周期订阅化]\n  C --&gt; C3[品类扩展推荐]\n  C --&gt; C4[阈值激励: 差一单达标]\n  D --&gt; D1[客单提升: 组合装/加购]\n  D --&gt; D2[品类广度: 相邻品类]\n  D --&gt; D3[增值服务: 延保/优先配送/专属]\n  D --&gt; D4[权益分层: 见第四章第2篇]\n  C1 --&gt; E[购买间隔缩短]\n  C2 --&gt; E\n  C3 --&gt; E\n  D1 --&gt; F[单次净贡献提升]\n  D2 --&gt; F\n  D3 --&gt; F</pre><p>图中成长侧的四个抓手与成熟侧的四个抓手互不重叠，这是本文的边界设计：<strong>同一批客户在同一时期只应接受一侧的动作</strong>，否则会出现「既被提醒该买了、又被推销组合装」的重复触达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成长期提频-节奏是可预测的\">成长期提频：节奏是可预测的</h2><p>成长期最有价值的洞察是：<strong>多数品类的复购是有物理节奏的</strong>。消耗品有用完的周期，配件有磨损或升级的周期，季节品有节令周期。这意味着提频不是「随机多发几次提醒」，而是「在正确的时点提醒一次」。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手一：购买节奏预测与提醒。</strong> 对每个客户在给定品类上估计其消耗周期，在下一次该买的时间窗口前触达。预测方法与 AI 留存与复购增长系统里的复购时机预测一致，本文不重复其模型细节，只强调与 CLV 相关的两点：一是提醒的时点精度对转化的影响是指数级的（提前太多用户还没用完，滞后太多用户已经买完了），二是<strong>该买未买的时点正是最佳触达窗口</strong>，而不是「很久没买」之后的健康提醒。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>窗口</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>lastOrder</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>cycle</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>category</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{窗口} = \\big[\\, \\hat{T}_i - \\delta_1,\\; \\hat{T}_i + \\delta_2 \\,\\big], \\qquad \\hat{T}_i = \\text{lastOrder}_i + \\widehat{\\text{cycle}}_{i, \\text{category}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2968em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1412em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2968em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lastOrder</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3147em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9344em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cycle</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6944em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">category</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>抓手二：订阅化与周期购。</strong> 对确定性高的消耗品，把「提醒复购」升级为「自动周期购」，直接改变购买间隔的分布——订阅客户的间隔不再是随机的，而是被合同固定下来。这对 CLV 的影响是双重的：间隔缩短、且留存时长延长（取消订阅需要主动动作，天然降低流失率）。跨境场景下订阅化要解决本地支付授权、跨境配送承诺、以及不同市场的续费合规，具体机制属于跨境订阅与周期购系统的范围。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手三：品类扩展推荐。</strong> 客户在单一品类上的购买次数有天然上限，继续在同一品类上提频会遇到天花板；而每增加一个购买品类，留存率与总频次都会阶跃式上升。因此成长期的提频本质上是<strong>用品类数量换取总频次</strong>。推荐必须基于互补关系而非替代关系，复用商品推荐系统的关联推荐能力。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手四：阈值激励（差一单达标）。</strong> 当客户接近某个权益门槛（累计 3 单、累计消费满额）时，给一个「再买一单即可享受」的激励，其转化率显著高于无差别发券——因为目标已经被个体化为一个具体的、可完成的差距，且带有损失厌恶。这个抓手与第四章的权益分层（见 <a href=\"../clv-resource-allocation/differential-service\">差异化服务/权益分层</a>）是同一套门槛体系的两个使用面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成熟期价值挖掘-从频次到单次贡献\">成熟期价值挖掘：从频次到单次贡献</h2><p>成熟客户已经形成购买习惯，此时继续推提频激励的边际收益很低，而且会侵蚀利润——他们本来就会买，你只是把全价购买变成了折扣购买。成熟期正确的方向是提高单次贡献与钱包份额。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手一：客单结构升级。</strong> 通过组合装、套装、加量包、配件捆绑等方式提高单次购买的商品数量。这里的关键是<strong>让升级成为默认选项而不是额外决策</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>用户感受</th>\n<th>净贡献影响</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组合装 / 套装</td>\n<td>省事、单价更优</td>\n<td>提升客单，可能降低单位毛利</td>\n<td>库存结构要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加购推荐（near-cart）</td>\n<td>顺手</td>\n<td>提升客单，毛利高</td>\n<td>过度推荐会引起反感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满额免邮门槛</td>\n<td>主动凑单</td>\n<td>提升客单</td>\n<td>门槛设置不当会降低转化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅升级（更大规格周期）</td>\n<td>长期省心</td>\n<td>提升客单与留存</td>\n<td>需要订阅基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>加购推荐是其中性价比最高的</strong>，因为它发生在用户已经决定购买的时刻，决策成本最低；而它的商品通常是高毛利配件或耗材。这个位置在成熟客户身上的收益远高于新客——新客对推荐的信任度低、对价格更敏感。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手二：品类广度拓展。</strong> 成熟客户的品类扩展不是「推荐相关商品」，而是「引入他尚未使用的相邻品类」。跨境场景下这一步有独特优势：成熟客户对平台的信任已经建立，跨品类尝试的心理门槛低于新客，而新客获取一个新品类的成本极高。度量上应当看<strong>品类数分布</strong>而非总消费额：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>品类广度</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>category</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>客户 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mtext> 在该品类有过成交</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{品类广度}_i = \\big| \\{\\text{category} : \\text{客户 } i \\text{ 在该品类有过成交}\\} \\big|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">品类广度</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">客户</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在该品类有过成交</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>购买 3 个以上品类的客户，其 12 个月留存率通常显著高于单品类客户（这个跃升关系的具体幅度因品类组合而异，必须用自己的数据验证，不要直接引用外部基准）。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手三：增值服务与保障。</strong> 延保、优先配送、退货运费保障、专属客服通道——这些的共同特征是<strong>提高单次交易的确定性</strong>，而确定性对成熟客户的支付意愿高于对新客。它们同时改善了净贡献（服务费收入）与留存（降低体验风险）。这类服务的分层提供属于第四章第 2 篇的范围（谁有资格获得、以什么价格）。</p>\n<p><strong>抓手四：权益分层的价值锚定。</strong> 成熟客户是权益体系最主要的受益人群，而权益设计的技术细节在第四章。本文只强调一个与阶段相关的事实：<strong>成熟期的权益应当以「维持行为」而不是「激励行为」为目标</strong>。给成熟客户「买满 X 送 Y」的激励，往往是给他本来就打算买的东西打折；给「保级条件」或「专属服务」的维持型权益，才是对成熟客户正确的资源投放形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量口径-两个阶段各自该看什么\">度量口径：两个阶段各自该看什么</h2><p>度量错配是这一章最常见的失败——用提频的指标衡量价值挖掘，或用价值的指标衡量提频。</p>\n<p><strong>成长期的正确指标</strong>：平均购买间隔（及其分布，不只是均值）、30/60/90 天复购率、品类数分布、第二次到第三次购买的转化率。<strong>不要用 GMV</strong>，因为它会被新客涌入和促销规模污染，看不出客户行为的变化。</p>\n<p><strong>成熟期的正确指标</strong>：单次净贡献（客单价扣除退货、履约、支付成本）、品类数、增值服务渗透率、单位客户的服务成本、以及「成熟期客户在下个季度的留存率」。</p>\n<p><strong>两个阶段共同的边界指标</strong>：净贡献 CLV 的变化（口径见 <a href=\"../1-clv-modeling/clv-cross-border-adjust\">跨境多币种与获客成本调整</a>），因为最终的资源分配决策（第四章）使用的就是这个数。</p>\n<p>一个必须建立的对照：<strong>任何提频或价值挖掘动作都要有对照组</strong>。成长期客户的购买间隔会因为品类自然节奏而变化，成熟客户的客单价会因为促销日历而变化；没有对照组的观测会把所有这些自然波动记在策略头上，形成虚假的成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>成长期与成熟期可优化的因子不同：前者调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（频次），后者调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{m}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（单次贡献）；同一批客户同期只应接受一侧的动作，否则重复触达。</li>\n<li>成长期提频的核心是「在正确的时点提醒一次」而非多发提醒；该买未买的窗口是最佳触达点，订阅化则直接改变间隔分布。</li>\n<li>单一品类的购买次数有天然上限，成长期提频的可持续路径是品类扩展——用品类数量换取总频次。</li>\n<li>成熟期推提频激励会侵蚀利润（把全价购买变成折扣购买）；正确方向是客单结构升级（其中加购推荐性价比最高）、品类广度拓展、增值服务、维持型权益。</li>\n<li>度量必须分阶段匹配：成长期看购买间隔与 30/60/90 天复购率（不看 GMV），成熟期看单次净贡献、品类数、服务渗透率与下季度留存。</li>\n<li>所有阶段策略都必须有对照组；没有对照，自然节奏与促销日历造成的波动会被全部误记为策略成效。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成长期提频与成熟期价值挖掘","id":"成长期提频与成熟期价值挖掘"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成长期与成熟期的杠杆不同","id":"核心概念-成长期与成熟期的杠杆不同"},{"level":2,"text":"成长期提频：节奏是可预测的","id":"成长期提频-节奏是可预测的"},{"level":2,"text":"成熟期价值挖掘：从频次到单次贡献","id":"成熟期价值挖掘-从频次到单次贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"度量口径：两个阶段各自该看什么","id":"度量口径-两个阶段各自该看什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新客首单与激活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/stage-strategy/onboarding-new"},"next":{"title":"衰退挽回与流失重激活","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customer-lifetime-value-operations/stage-strategy/winback-churn"}}